From: Brhett <36874370+jingledingle521@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:53:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 20/35] Finder column view: own context menu, title and footer
 follow the active column, hidden files

The column view acts on its own items: Open, Open With, Share > AirDrop,
Get Info, Rename, Move to Trash, Copy, Copy Location (New Folder and Paste
on empty space). Dolphin's menu would have acted on the hidden view's
selection instead.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KdkdNUmoM62iDwjRop6X5f
---
